WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.040
Adventurers wanted
for a hazardous journey.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.340
Long months of total darkness.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:11.660
Constant danger.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.900
A safe return
is not guaranteed.

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.940
Glory and recognition,

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:27.400
if successful.
